<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Life says Fullam to leave the group.</title>
<headline>Irish Life says Fullam to leave the group.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish Life Plc said on Thursday that Peter Fullam, executive director with responsibility for new developments, has indicated his intention to leave the group in the middle of the current year.  </p>
<p>Fullam said he wished to become involved in new challenges outside the group, Irish Life said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
